.Dd November 27, 2026
.Dt TALUS.TOML 5
.Os macOS 15.0
.Sh NAME
.Nm talus.toml
.Nd configuration file format for the Talus macOS tiling window manager
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Pa ~/.talus.toml
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
configures keyboard modifiers, workspace mode, layout geometry, application
rules, and the xmobar-inspired macOS menu-bar status item for
.Xr talus 1 .
Every key is optional; omitted keys use their defaults.
Changes saved from disk hot-reload automatically (every ~2 seconds or via
.Ic Cmd+R
in the menu bar), and changes saved from the native Settings window patch
the file in place via
.Li std.toml.patch
without stripping comments.
.Sh TOP-LEVEL KEYS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va modifiers = [ "control", "option" ]
Non-empty list of distinct modifier names chosen from
.Cm control ,
.Cm option ,
and
.Cm command .
.Cm shift
is reserved for swap and throw shortcuts.
.El
.Sh WORKSPACES SECTION
.Li [workspaces]
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va mode = "native" | "virtual"
Selects macOS Spaces tracking
.Pq Cm native , default
or Talus virtual workspaces
.Pq Cm virtual .
.It Va count = 5
Number of virtual workspaces
.Pq Li 1..9 .
.It Va labels = [ ... ]
Up to 32 display labels
.Pq 1\(en16 characters each
exposed as
.Li %label% .
.It Va icons = [ ... ]
Up to 32 SF Symbol names or text glyphs
.Pq 1\(en64 characters each
exposed as
.Li %icon% .
.El
.Sh LAYOUT SECTION
.Li [layout]
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va master_ratio = 0.5
Master pane fraction
.Pq Li 0.2..0.8 .
.It Va ratio_step = 0.03
Resize step per
.Ic <Mod>+H/L
.Pq greater than Li 0.0 , at most Li 0.2 .
.It Va master_count = 1
Initial number of windows in the master pane
.Pq Li 1..20 .
.It Va outer_gap = 0.0
Outer display margin in macOS logical points
.Pq Li 0.0..64.0 .
Applied to Tall, Mirror Tall, and Full.
.It Va inner_gap = 0.0
Inter-window gap in macOS logical points
.Pq Li 0.0..64.0 .
Applied to Tall and Mirror Tall.
.El
.Sh RULES SECTION
.Li [rules] ,
.Li [rules.app_workspaces] ,
and
.Li [[rules.float_windows]]
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va ignore_apps = [ "com.example.App", ... ]
Bundle identifiers ignored completely by Talus.
.It Va [rules.app_workspaces]
Maps up to 64 application bundle identifiers to a virtual workspace number
.Pq Li 1..9
or workspace label name.
.It Va [[rules.float_windows]]
Up to 64 rules, each with
.Va app
.Pq bundle ID
and optional
.Va titles
and
.Va except_titles
arrays
.Pq up to 32 patterns each .
Patterns containing
.Li *
use case-insensitive glob matching;
.Va except_titles
takes precedence over
.Va titles .
.El
.Sh STATUS SECTION
.Li [status]
and
.Li [[status.commands]]
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va show_icon = true
Draw the Talus vector emblem beside the status text.
.It Va template
Rich status string
.Pq \(<= 1024 characters
supporting
.Li %spaces% ,
.Li %layout% ,
.Li %title% ,
.Li %count% ,
.Li %custom% ,
.Li %<cmd>% ,
and
.Li %% ,
as well as nested markup tags:
.Li <fc=fg,bg>...</fc> ,
.Li <box type=Bottom|Top|Full|HBoth|VBoth width=N color=... radius=R>...</box> ,
.Li <fn=N>...</fn> ,
and
.Li <sf=symbol.name> .
.It Va workspace_current , workspace_other
Templates
.Pq \(<= 512 characters
for active and inactive Spaces/workspaces using
.Li %label% ,
.Li %index% ,
.Li %icon% ,
.Li %occupied% ,
and
.Li %fullscreen% .
.It Va fonts = [ ... ]
Up to 16 installed font names indexed by
.Li <fn=0> ,
.Li <fn=1> ,
etc.
.It Va font_size = 11.5
Base status bar font size in points
.Pq Li 8.0..14.0 .
.It Va text_file , state_file
Optional input file for
.Li %custom%
and atomic
.Pq Li 0600
JSON export path; the two paths must be distinct.
.It Va [[status.commands]]
Up to 16 asynchronous commands launched directly without a shell in isolated
process groups.
Fields:
.Va name
.Pq unique non-reserved identifier ,
.Va executable
.Pq absolute path ,
.Va arguments
.Pq \(<= 32 strings ,
.Va interval
.Pq Li 1.0..3600.0 s ,
.Va timeout
.Pq Li 0.1..10.0 s ,
.Va markup
.Pq default false ,
and
.Va on_change
.Pq default false .
Each command receives current status JSON in
.Ev TALUS_STATUS_JSON .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
modifiers = ["control", "option"]

[workspaces]
mode = "virtual"
count = 5
labels = ["term", "web", "code", "chat", "misc"]

[layout]
master_ratio = 0.55
outer_gap = 10
inner_gap = 8

[rules.app_workspaces]
"com.apple.Terminal" = "term"
"com.apple.Safari" = "web"

[[rules.float_windows]]
app = "com.tencent.xinWeChat"
except_titles = ["微信", "WeChat"]

[status]
show_icon = true
template = "%spaces%  <fc=#89CFC2>%layout%</fc>  %clock%"
workspace_current = "<fc=#10201E,#89CFC2> %label%%fullscreen% </fc>"
workspace_other = "%label%%fullscreen%"

[[status.commands]]
name = "clock"
executable = "/bin/date"
arguments = ["+%H:%M"]
interval = 30
timeout = 2
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr talus 1
